#. ja: <num $n1>:<num2 $n2> <switch $n3><case><case>a.m.<case>p.m.</switch>
#. de: <if ($n3 == 1)><num $n1><else><if ($n1 == 0)>{12}<else><num $n1></if></if>:<num2 $n2> <switch $n3><case><case>a.m.<case>p.m.</switch>
#. fr: <if ($n3 == 1)><num $n1><else><if ($n1 == 0)>{12}<else><num $n1></if></if>:<num2 $n2> <switch $n3><case><case>am<case>pm</switch>
#. macro: <if ($n3 == 1)><num $n1><else><if ($n1 == 0)>{12}<else><num $n1></if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 0)>{12}<else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num2 $n2> — a number with at least two digits, such as 05; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <switch $n3><case><case>a.m.<case>p.m.</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:15072:0:0"
msgid "<if ($n3 == 1)><num $n1><else><if ($n1 == 0)>{12}<else><num $n1></if></if>:<num2 $n2> <switch $n3><case><case>a.m.<case>p.m.</switch>"
msgstr ""

