#. ja: 飼育委託の依頼には、<br>1日毎にシェルダレースクリップ:青船貨<num $n1>枚がかかります。<br>飼育委託中は、餌やりと畜産素材採集を魔法人形が行い、<br>最大で20個の畜産素材をストックしておくことができます。<br>費用は、依頼時と（地球時間）<reset-time 17><if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時毎に、<br>自動的に支払われます。<br>※すでに当日分が支払われていた場合、追加費用はかかりません。<br><br>飼育委託を依頼してよろしいですか？<br><br>依頼後、以下の状況になった場合、飼育委託は停止されます。<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>　・シェルダレースクリップ:青船貨が不足し、<br>　　費用の支払いができなかった場合<br>　・採集済畜産素材数が20個に達した場合<br>※再開が可能な状態になると、自動で飼育委託は再開され、<br>　再開時に費用が支払われます。<br>※飼育委託により、魔法人形が採集を行った場合は、<br>　開拓経験値を獲得することはできません。</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. de: Der aufgestellte Fütterungsplan wird täglich <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauri<else>blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris</if> kosten.<br>Solange der Fütterungsplan in Kraft gesetzt ist, wird die Marionette deine Tiere füttern und ihr Material sammeln. Bis zu 20 Weideerzeugnisse eines jeden Tieres kann sie lagern. Die Kosten für den Plan werden beim ersten Bestätigen und danach täglich um <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit) automatisch bezahlt. Hast du für einen Tag bereits bezahlt, fallen keine weiteren Kosten an.<br>Fortfahren und den Fütterungsplan in Kraft setzen?<br><br>※ Der Plan wird abgebrochen, wenn:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>・ du nicht genügend blaue Cieldaläen-Kauris hast.<br>・ die Grenze von 20 Weideerzeugnissen erreicht ist.<br>※ Sobald du genügend Kauris bzw. die Erzeugnisse abgeholt hast, werden dir die Kosten berechnet und der Plan automatisch fortgesetzt.<br>※ Wird die Arbeit von einer Marionette durchgeführt, erhältst du keine Inselroutine.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. fr: Vous pouvez confier un animal à un curateur pour <num $n1> assignats insulaires azur par jour, jusqu'à un maximum de 20 ressources par animal.<br>Les honoraires sont débités lors de la demande de curation, puis une seule fois par jour à <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).<br><br>Voulez-vous confier votre animal au curateur<nbsp>?<br><br>La curation sera interrompue dans les cas suivants<nbsp>:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>- Vous manquez d'assignats insulaires azur.<br>- Limite de 20 ressources animalières atteinte.<br>* Une fois les conditions remplies, la collecte des ressources et le paiement reprendront au<shy>to<shy>ma<shy>ti<shy>que<shy>ment.<br>* Lorsqu'un animal est confié, les poupées magiques s'occupent de la collecte. Aucun point d'expérience insulaire ne vous sera attribué.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. macro: <kilo $n1 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 1, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <reset-time 17> — sets the time placeholders to the next daily or weekly reset; hour = 17 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = hour of the set time, 0–23 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = hour of the set time, 0–23 >= 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:15223:0:0"
msgid "The creature comforter requires a daily fee of <kilo $n1 \",\"> seafarer's cowries to provide caretaking services, which will be collected at the time of request and then at <reset-time 17><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> (Earth time) each day thereafter. Daily fees are only charged once.<br><br>A team of mammets will administer feed and collect up to 20 leavings per animal.<br><br>Entrust the creature comforter with care of this animal using the following feed?<br><br>※Care will be halted in the following circumstances:<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>　・Seafarer's cowries are insufficient.<br>　・Leavings have reached the maximum of 20.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>※Care and associated fees will resume automatically once required conditions have been met.<br>※Leavings collected via the caretaking service will not provide island EXP."
msgstr ""

