msgid "A new season has begun, and you have unclaimed rewards!<br><br>Speak with the seasonal quartermaster at the Wolves' Den Pier to claim last season's tier rewards.<br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Last season's rewards will only be available until the close of the current season.</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
