#. ja: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>のジョブチェンジにあたり、<sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0>のホットバー／クロスホットバーの設定を<sheet ClassJob $n1 0>に引き継ぎます。
#. de: Wenn du deinen Job auf <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> wechselst, kannst du die Kommandomenü- und Kreuzkommandomenü-Einstellungen von <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0> übertragen.
#. fr: En changeant votre job en <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, vous avez la possibilité de transférer les paramètres des barres et croix de raccourcis de la classe <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0>.
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob "<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>" 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = text with macros, column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <sheet ClassJob $n1 29> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = ClassJob, row = number parameter 1, column = 29 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:15490:0:0"
msgid "By changing your job to <sheet ClassJob $n1 0>, you may carry over the hotbar and cross hotbar settings from <sheet ClassJob \"<sheet ClassJob $n1 29>\" 0>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 引き継ぐ
#. de: Übertragen
#. fr: Transférer
msgctxt "Addon:15491:0:0"
msgid "Transfer"
